    exp(cua-driver): measurement-only phase marks for the R2-04 AT-SPI profile
    
    Adds cua_driver_core::phase_trace: when CUA_DRIVER_PHASE_TRACE_FILE names a
    writable file, the registry dispatch boundary, the Linux element click AX
    route, the focus guard, the cached-ref AT-SPI action and set_value append
    JSONL marks (wall + monotonic ns). Unset (the default) is a OnceLock read and
    return: no file, no behaviour change. Research branch only; not for upstream.
    
    Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

